      "Song generation in progress or awaiting API setup...\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "#| echo: false\n",
    "\n",
    "if song_file and Path(song_file).exists():\n",
    "    print(f\"<audio controls style='width: 100%;'><source src='{song_file}' type='audio/wav'></audio>\")\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n**Your song is ready to listen to!**\")\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n---\\n\")\n",
    "    print(f\"**Student:** {metadata['student']}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"**Your Lyrics/Theme:**\\n> {metadata['lyrics']}\\n\")\n",
    "    print(f\"**Music Style Requested:**\\n> {metadata['music_prompt']}\\n\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"Song generation in progress or awaiting API setup...\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8fb54521",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 📚 Reflection Questions\n",
    "\n",
    "After listening to your generated song, consider:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Authorship & Creativity**: How did you and the AI contribute to this song? Who is the \"author\"?\n",
    "\n",
    "2. **Economic Concepts**: Does the music reflect the economic themes in your lyrics? Why or why not?\n",
    "\n",
    "3. **Limitations**: What did the AI do well? What would you change or improve?\n",
    "\n",
    "4. **Monetary Economics Connection**: How could this creative approach help explain monetary policy concepts to others?\n",
    "\n",
    "5. **Ethical Reflection**: In what ways is this different from a student writing a song entirely on their own?\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🔧 Setup Instructions: ACE-Step 1.5\n",
    "\n",
    "This activity uses **ACE-Step 1.5**, a free, open-source music generation model that runs **locally on your computer**. No API keys needed!\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 1: Install ACE-Step (One-time setup)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Windows/macOS/Linux:**\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "# 1) Install uv (universal Python package manager)\n",
    "# Go to: https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh\n",
    "# Windows: Download and run the installer\n",
    "# Or use PowerShell:\n",
    "powershell -ExecutionPolicy BypassUser -c \"irm https://astral.sh/uv/install.ps1 | iex\"\n",
    "\n",
    "# 2) Clone the ACE-Step repository\n",
    "git clone https://github.com/ACE-Step/ACE-Step-1.5.git\n",
    "cd ACE-Step-1.5\n",
    "\n",
    "# 3) Install dependencies\n",
    "uv sync\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 2: Start the ACE-Step API\n",
    "\n",
    "Before running the activity, start the API in a separate terminal:\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "cd ACE-Step-1.5\n",
    "uv run acestep-api\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "You should see:\n",
    "```\n",
    "INFO:     Uvicorn running on http://127.0.0.1:8001\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Keep this terminal open while students use the activity.**\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 3: Run the Activity\n",
    "\n",
    "With the API running, open this file (`topic2ludic.qmd`) in Quarto Preview:\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "quarto preview topic2ludic.qmd\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Students enter their lyrics and music preferences, and ACE-Step generates the audio locally.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 4: Optional - Use the Gradio UI\n",
    "\n",
    "If preferred, students can also use ACE-Step's built-in UI:\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "uv run acestep\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Then open `http://localhost:7860` in a browser.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## ✅ Why ACE-Step 1.5?\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Free & Open-source** — No subscriptions or API keys\n",
    "- **Local generation** — Runs entirely on your computer\n",
    "- **Fast** — Optimized for modern GPUs (CPU supported too)\n",
    "- **Multi-language** — Supports lyrics in many languages\n",
    "- **Lyric-aware** — Conditions music generation on student-written content\n",
    "- **Scalable** — No rate limits for 10 concurrent student groups\n",
    "- **Educational** — Clear boundary: students write meaning, AI generates sound\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 📖 Resources\n",
    "\n",
    "- **ACE-Step GitHub**: [github.com/ACE-Step/ACE-Step-1.5](https://github.com/ACE-Step/ACE-Step-1.5)\n",
    "- **ACE-Step Paper**: \"ACE-Step 1.5: Pushing the Boundaries of Open-Source Music Generation\"\n",
    "- **Hugging Face Model**: [huggingface.co/ACE-Step/Ace-Step1.5](https://huggingface.co/ACE-Step/Ace-Step1.5)\n",
    "- **uv Package Manager**: [astral.sh/uv](https://astral.sh/uv)\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "**Enjoy creating! 🎵**"
   ]
  }
